{"id":"a013c821ea7838a953869615b0bdcfdb298cc09f","axis":"silent","repo":"django/django","sha":"a013c821ea7838a953869615b0bdcfdb298cc09f","parsed":{"files":[{"path":"django/contrib/auth/middleware.py","lines":["@@ -27,6 +27,8 @@ async def auser(request):"," "," "," class AuthenticationMiddleware(MiddlewareMixin):","+    async_capable = False","+","     def process_request(self, request):","         if not hasattr(request, \"session\"):","             raise ImproperlyConfigured("],"additions":2,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"django/contrib/flatpages/middleware.py","lines":["@@ -5,6 +5,8 @@"," "," "," class FlatpageFallbackMiddleware(MiddlewareMixin):","+    async_capable = False","+","     def process_response(self, request, response):","         if response.status_code != 404:","             return response  # No need to check for a flatpage for non-404 responses."],"additions":2,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"django/contrib/messages/middleware.py","lines":["@@ -8,6 +8,8 @@ class MessageMiddleware(MiddlewareMixin):","     Middleware that handles temporary messages.","     \"\"\""," ","+    async_capable = False","+","     def process_request(self, request):","         request._messages = default_storage(request)"," "],"additions":2,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"django/contrib/redirects/middleware.py","lines":["@@ -8,6 +8,8 @@"," "," "," class RedirectFallbackMiddleware(MiddlewareMixin):","+    async_capable = False","+","     # Defined as class-level attributes to be subclassing-friendly.","     response_gone_class = HttpResponseGone","     response_redirect_class = HttpResponsePermanentRedirect"],"additions":2,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"django/contrib/sessions/middleware.py","lines":["@@ -10,6 +10,8 @@"," "," "," class SessionMiddleware(MiddlewareMixin):","+    async_capable = False","+","     def __init__(self, get_response):","         super().__init__(get_response)","         engine = import_module(settings.SESSION